  "translation": "Na nau, kisim wantaim long ol yet sevenpela bulmakau man na sevenpela dia, na go long wokman bilong mi Aiyob, na bai yumi — na yu — kukim ofa bilong paia ol i kukim olgeta bilong ol yet; na Aiyob, wokman bilong mi, bai pregim long ol yet, bilong olsem mi ken akseptim ⟨⟨em⟩⟩ — long we, mi no mekim olsem nupela pasin — olsem foli — wantaim ol yet; long wanem, ol i no tokim mi tok stret, olsem wokman bilong mi Aiyob.",
